					"content": "Oh, aku dengar ada beberapa makanan lezat di Mondstadt — Sweet Madame, Mondstadt Grilled Fish, Fisherman's Toast, Calla Lily Seafood Soup...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						222000202
